345→// hookCmdPrefix returns the command prefix for hook scripts and warning messages.
346→// Returns "go run ./cmd/entire/main.go" when local_dev is enabled.
347→// When absolutePath is true, resolves the full binary path via os.Executable()
348→// and returns an error if resolution fails. This is needed for GUI git clients
